{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123708","id":4602516970,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABElTV6g","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123708","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123708.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123708.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123708","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123708/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123708/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123708/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6853e7cb577f57a4c8285c7508865d74cbdaf05d","number":123708,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[ObjectDB Profiler] Improve filter options and make easier to identified what changed when making a diff","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarianoGnu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Entries in the list will show colors to represent Added, Removed, Modified\r\n- Added a toolbar to filter Added, Removed, Modified, Unmodified objects, with Unmodified unchecked by default\r\n- Filter textbar now supports filtering in the form 'column_title:match'\r\n\r\n- **Depends on #123619**\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nWhen comparing snapshots is hard to find specific objects, and also know at first glance if an object was added, removed, or modified.\r\nThis makes this distinction quite easily\r\nUpcomming PR will improve the visualization of Inbound/Outbound references, and also add a list of modified properties when making a diff between snapshots\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ee42804-7714-4d6d-bf27-4d9fea7100e2\r\n\r\n### Known issue\r\n\r\nClicking in the inbound/outbound list an object that was hidden by the diff-status filter does nothing.\r\nI'm not sure what to do about it. Should show some warning? Make all objects visible? Make all visible if the user double clicks? I'm open to suggestions\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","des